flowchart TD
  PR[Pull request] --> STATIC[Lint, type checks, secret/dependency scan]
  STATIC --> UNIT[Unit + authorization tests]
  UNIT --> CONTRACT[OpenAPI validation + compatibility]
  CONTRACT --> COMPOSE[Docker Compose integration tests]
  COMPOSE --> IMAGE[Build immutable API image]
  IMAGE --> SCAN[Image scan + SBOM + artifact metadata]
  SCAN --> KIND[Create kind cluster, deploy, smoke/e2e tests]
  KIND --> CLEAN[Destroy test resources and retain sanitized reports]
  CLEAN --> REVIEW[Code review and risk review]
  REVIEW --> STAGING[Human-approved staging promotion]
  STAGING --> GATES[Legal, PSP, security, recovery and operations gates]
  GATES -->|All required approvals| RELEASE[Controlled production release]
  GATES -->|Any gate fails| BLOCK[Block release and track remediation]
